{"version":1,"content":"<p>紀念中國工農紅軍長征勝利90周年大會22日上午在北京人民大會堂隆重舉行。</p><p>中共中央總書記、國家主席、中央軍委主席習近平發表講話強調，必須持之以恆推進全面從嚴治黨，不斷實現黨的自我淨化、自我完善、自我革新、自我提高。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T07:22:12.628547+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T06:45:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T12:37:43.904765+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T07:17:38.701536+00:00","content_hash":"dcb2ae1b107cc87ecd3592c70eb5d43a0f5c99710eb6ccdb96aafc05ac73d760","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}